                performance of the three mage sisters.
                
                I'd be okay watching her battle over
                and over if nobody could defeat her\.")
    }
    else
    {
        msgbox("No way\. you managed to defeat
                Flamberge? Who even are you?")
    }
    release
}

text CastleArena_Text_Cafe
{
    "Arena seats seem like the perfect place
    to sell snacks to hungry customers, so
    I'm setting up a little food stand here!"
}

text CastleArena_Text_CafeWin
{
    "That was some seriously incredible
    Helper battling skill! Great work!
    
    With hot shots like you, I bet this
    place will draw huge crowds soon\.
    and then I'll be busy, busy, busy!"
}

text CastleArena_Text_Socialite
{
    "It's easy to see the results coming
    when one group of competitors keep
    dominating every single tournament.
                
    Will you be able to inject some spice
    into this Arena, I wonder?"
}

text CastleArena_Text_SocialiteWin
{
    "Bravo! You and your Helpers were really
    something else!
                
    Knowing there are strong competitors
    like you traveling here has restored
    my enthusiasm for Arena spectating!"
}

script CastleArena_EventScript_Soldier
{
    lock
    faceplayer
    if(flag(FLAG_BADGE03_GET))
    {
        msgbox("Seems like those girls are ready to move
                on elsewhere after you defeated them.
                
                It's a good thing that challengers will
                be able to earn Brooches here again.
                
                \.it also cements that you're a serious
                contender for the Royal Royale's crown.
                Much to the Great King's chagrin\.
                
                I wonder how things will shake out.
                For now, keep doing your best, alright?")
    }
    else
    {
        msgbox("I'm keeping an eye on things here to see
            just how unbeatable that trio really is.
            
            It would be a problem if nobody could
            win the Royal Royal because of them\.")
    }
    release
}

